# Styling & UI

## Library (`packages/doodle-ui`) — inline styles + CSS variables, NO Tailwind
- Components style with inline `style={{...}}`; `className` is only passed through via `cn(className)` (`utils.ts`, a tiny filter-join — not clsx).
- Consumer overrides: `style` is spread last, so it wins.
- Font: `fontFamily: doodleUiFontFamily`, weight `doodleUiFontWeight(600)` (both resolve `--doodle-ui-font*` vars).
- Tokens in `src/styles.css`: `--doodle-ui-roughness|bowing|stroke-width|stroke-color|fill-style|font-family|bg-color|text-color|color-{info,warning,error,success}`. Dark via `[data-theme="dark"]`, `.dark`, or `prefers-color-scheme`.
- JS palette constants: `SKETCH_COLORS` / `DARK_SKETCH_COLORS` in `types.ts`. Accent/status values were tuned for WCAG AA (see `A11Y-AUDIT.md`) — run `pnpm --filter doodleui-react audit:contrast` after changing any color.
- Resolve colors with `useSketchTheme(sketchColor)` → `{ ink, accent, accentFill, secondaryFill, isDark, ... }`; never hardcode ink.

## Sketch chrome
- Draw borders/fills with `<RoughSvg shape="rectangle|ellipse|line|line-vertical|path" />` inside a `position: relative` parent; put HTML content at `position: relative; zIndex: 1`.
- RoughSvg is `aria-hidden` and `pointerEvents: none`. Never put meaningful content in the SVG.
- Animate with `useDrawIn(ref, DRAW_IN_DURATION_MS, shouldAnimate, seed)` — animates `stroke-dashoffset` only.

## Docs site (`apps/docs`) — Tailwind 3
- Site tokens are CSS vars in `app/globals.css` mapped in `tailwind.config.ts`: `paper`, `ink`, `accent`, `mute`, `chalkink`, `chalkboard`; fonts `font-sans` (Outfit), `font-hand`, `font-mono` (IBM Plex Mono).
- Use doodle-ui components from `"doodleui-react"` for UI; Tailwind for layout. Example (`components/blocks/hero/HeroMinimal.tsx`):

```tsx
<section className={`bg-paper px-6 py-16 text-center text-ink md:py-24 ${className ?? ""}`.trim()}>
  <Badge variant="accent">{badge}</Badge>
```

- Blocks (`components/blocks/**`) must use only doodle-ui components + theme tokens and be self-contained single files (users copy them).
- Theme switching: `ComponentThemeProvider` + inline bootstrap script in `app/layout.tsx` set `data-theme`, `data-component-theme`, and `.light/.dark` on `<html>` from localStorage.
